# The repo stores LF, and every checkout gets LF — including on Windows.
# Without this, a Windows-side clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the
# whole tree to CRLF, and every file then reads as modified with an
# identical insertion and deletion count: a diff of thousands of lines that
# changes nothing. `text=auto` still leaves detected binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
